00:29:09,370 --> 00:29:13,080
ATTORNEY: Just your best sense, if you have one.

423
00:29:13,080 --> 00:29:18,370
WITNESS B: A good ways. A quarter mile maybe. I've never measured it. When

424
00:29:18,370 --> 00:29:22,736
WITNESS B: you drive it, you come over the top and then you can

425
00:29:22,736 --> 00:29:26,430
WITNESS B: see the store down the hill in front of you.

426
00:29:26,430 --> 00:29:29,030
