00:29:29,030 --> 00:29:32,571
WITNESS B: No. Gentle. It's not a big hill. It's just

428
00:29:32,571 --> 00:29:36,450
WITNESS B: enough that you can't see what's past the top.

429
00:29:36,450 --> 00:29:41,827
ATTORNEY: And when you drive east on that stretch yourself, as you said you

430
00:29:41,827 --> 00:29:46,460
ATTORNEY: do weekly, what do you see when you come over that rise?

