00:30:01,670 --> 00:30:06,772
WITNESS B: Flatter. The highway runs on straight. There are fences, some yards and

435
00:30:06,772 --> 00:30:10,940
WITNESS B: houses back off the road, some power poles along the side.

436
00:30:10,940 --> 00:30:15,020
ATTORNEY: Are there trees along the highway near the intersection?

