00:30:15,020 --> 00:30:21,700
WITNESS B: Some, back from the road. Not right on the shoulder. It's mostly grass along the edges.

438
00:30:21,700 --> 00:30:26,150
ATTORNEY: Are there any buildings at the intersection besides the store?

439
00:30:26,150 --> 00:30:32,460
WITNESS B: Not right there, no. The store is the main thing. There are houses further off.

440
00:30:32,460 --> 00:30:36,170
