837
00:58:15,850 --> 00:58:18,240
OPPOSING COUNSEL: Objection. Hearsay. Move to strike.

838
00:58:18,240 --> 00:58:22,871
ATTORNEY: Noted. I'm not asking what the store employee said. I'm just asking

839
00:58:22,871 --> 00:58:26,810
