844
00:58:43,250 --> 00:58:44,970
ATTORNEY: Did you pass?

845
00:58:44,970 --> 00:58:47,370
WITNESS B: Yes. No restrictions except reading.

846
00:58:47,370 --> 00:58:51,104
ATTORNEY: Is there anything about how you were feeling that afternoon,

847
00:58:51,104 --> 00:58:54,900
ATTORNEY: tired, sick, anything, that would have affected what you saw?

848
00:58:54,900 --> 00:59:00,040
WITNESS B: No. I felt fine. I'd just done my shopping. I was just waiting.

849
00:59:00,040 --> 00:59:04,435
ATTORNEY: I think that covers the car's approach. In a moment I'm going

850
00:59:04,435 --> 00:59:08,685
ATTORNEY: to turn to the truck. Before I do, is there anything you've

851
00:59:08,685 --> 00:59:12,720
ATTORNEY: said about the car that you'd like to change or correct?

852
00:59:12,720 --> 00:59:14,780
WITNESS B: No. That's all true.

853
00:59:14,780 --> 00:59:17,868
ATTORNEY: Counsel, I'm about to move on to a new

854
00:59:17,868 --> 00:59:21,280
ATTORNEY: subject. Do you need anything before I do?

855
00:59:21,280 --> 00:59:23,000
