00:59:32,010 --> 00:59:37,040
ATTORNEY: describe the grade, the slope of the hill, from what you could see?

859
00:59:37,040 --> 00:59:39,990
WITNESS B: Gentle. It's not steep. It just goes down a

860
00:59:39,990 --> 00:59:43,900
