00:59:50,410 --> 00:59:54,276
WITNESS B: No. If anything, it made it easier, because it was

864
00:59:54,276 --> 00:59:57,600
WITNESS B: coming down toward me. I could see it fine.

865
00:59:57,600 --> 01:00:00,000
ATTORNEY: Thank you. Let's turn to the truck.

