ATTORNEY: All right. I want to shift now from the

867
01:00:03,668 --> 01:00:07,430
ATTORNEY: car to the truck. Is that okay with you?

868
01:00:07,430 --> 01:00:08,910
WITNESS B: That's fine.

869
01:00:08,910 --> 01:00:12,584
ATTORNEY: At some point that afternoon, before the crash, did

870
01:00:12,584 --> 01:00:15,970
ATTORNEY: you notice a large truck near the intersection?

871
01:00:15,970 --> 01:00:21,540
WITNESS B: Yes. A big white truck. A tractor with a long trailer behind it.

872
01:00:21,540 --> 01:00:25,260
ATTORNEY: Do you remember when you first noticed it?

