01:00:51,250 --> 01:00:57,940
WITNESS B: It was in the turn lane. The little left-turn lane they have there for the crossover.

880
01:00:57,940 --> 01:01:02,233
ATTORNEY: Just so the record is clear, that's the turn lane on the

881
01:01:02,233 --> 01:01:07,600
