01:01:09,450 --> 01:01:15,770
ATTORNEY: How did you know it was in the turn lane and not the regular lane?

884
01:01:15,770 --> 01:01:22,122
WITNESS B: Because it was over on the left, by the median, where the lane cuts in. The

885
01:01:22,122 --> 01:01:28,390
WITNESS B: regular lanes were to the right of it, and cars were going by it in those.

886
01:01:28,390 --> 01:01:33,220
